---
// The brief's "profil pe scurt": what kind of problems he works on, drawn from
// what he has actually built rather than from adjectives about himself.
---

<section class="profile glass" aria-labelledby="profile-heading">
  <h2 id="profile-heading">What I work on</h2>

  <p>
    I study economic cybernetics in Bucharest and build things alongside it:
    the online shop a coffee brand sells through, a student association's
    design process, a simulation of what happens to a market when traders copy
    each other instead of reading the numbers.
  </p>

  <p>
    The thread running through them is systems with moving parts. I like
    working out how they behave, then making something people can actually
    use.
  </p>
</section>

